cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "orbit-watch: a smartwatch OS and board design for the nRF54L15"
abstract: "A Cortex-M33 kernel derived from orbit-os with tickless idle, deep-sleep power states and memory-LCD partial refresh, a watchface with integer step counting and PPG heart rate, and a SKiDL schematic of an nRF54L15 / nPM1300 / BMI270 / MAX30101 / Sharp memory-LCD watch board."
authors:
  - name: "the orbit-watch authors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-26"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/coopersimpson101-debug/orbit-watch"
keywords:
  - smartwatch
  - rtos
  - cortex-m33
  - nrf54l15
  - low-power
  - memory-lcd
  - kicad
  - skidl
